<title>BELGIUM: EU Commission proposes 5 pct 1998 cereals setaside.</title>
<headline>EU Commission proposes 5 pct 1998 cereals setaside.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission proposed on Thursday that the compulsory cereals setaside rate for the 1998 harvest should remain unchanged at five percent.</p>
<p>The proposal will almost certainly be approved by EU farm ministers who last month unanimously called for a five percent rate.</p>
<p>Farnmers will have to take five percent of their arable land out of production in order to claim EU farm subsidies.</p>
</text>
